Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.23,0:00:08.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Six... Seven... Eight...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.02,0:00:13.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nine... Ten... Eleven...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.70,0:00:16.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll hide here for now...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.74,0:00:21.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.00,0:00:27.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not now.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:27.25,0:00:29.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The cops'll get you.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.10,0:00:38.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.81,0:00:42.64,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The scent of his shampoo
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.77,0:00:47.15,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,mixed with a touch of sweat
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.90,0:00:51.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,set my heart aflutter.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.82,0:00:58.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san, stay and hide.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.20,0:01:02.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I knew there was a robber here!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get him!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't let him escape!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.08,0:01:09.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They caught him...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.71,0:01:11.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's my fault. {this matches the end of the episode}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.26,0:01:15.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I've gotta free him!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.66,0:01:39.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.74,0:01:43.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:48.00,0:01:49.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't go back...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.63,0:01:51.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...to those days. {???}
