Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.35,0:03:28.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba, you brought lunch again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.43,0:03:31.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just can't get myself to hit up the school shop again.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.64,0:03:33.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right, there's that lunch lady.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.06,0:03:38.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You totally lucked out when that guy covered for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.11,0:03:39.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.45,0:03:42.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not something to laugh about!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:42.32,0:03:45.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You two doubted me just as much as she did!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.37,0:03:46.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can you blame us?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.83,0:03:49.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We didn't see what happened.
