Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.54,0:03:58.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Have you lost it, Futaba?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:58.13,0:03:59.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.13,0:04:03.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Going somewhere else to eat your lunch again? {"here today either" is a bit of an adverb pile}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.63,0:04:05.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where do you even eat?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.43,0:04:07.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.10,0:04:11.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I have a little picnic with my friends from another class.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.35,0:04:12.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's pretty fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.23,0:04:16.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So cute I'm gonna die...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.61,0:04:18.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,God, she ticks me off.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.19,0:04:21.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've gotta wonder what guys see in those cutesy types.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.86,0:04:23.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, who's on duty?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.66,0:04:25.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.91,0:04:28.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've got your class's homework and printouts.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.49,0:04:30.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come pick them up at the faculty office.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.08,0:04:31.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sounds like it's gonna be heavy. {she's saying that notebooks and shit are heavy in general, not just right now}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Will you help?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:39.30,0:04:41.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do your best, Futaba. {this generic response is intended to be sarcastic}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.01,0:04:42.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See ya later.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.51,0:04:47.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's so cold!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Makita-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:59.77,0:05:02.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It wouldn't kill you to eat inside when it's this cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.90,0:05:06.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The sun's out today, so it's actually pretty comfortable.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No way! It's freezing out here!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.45,0:05:15.67,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Yeah, anyone would find her cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.54,0:05:20.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's like my old one.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.47,0:05:29.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um, you can have this if you'd like. It's an extra.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:30.14,0:05:32.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But that kind of thing doesn't really suit me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.39,0:05:34.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.43,0:05:36.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.40,0:05:43.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wow, her hands are ice-cold.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.40,0:05:46.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to talk with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.74,0:05:50.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It means a lot, since all the girls seem to hate me. {I think this goes with the previous line, as in "thanks for talking to me even though everyone hates me"}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.62,0:05:55.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I know I come off as trying too hard to appear cute.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.71,0:06:00.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's because I get nervous in front of boys and end up putting on a front.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.75,0:06:06.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But the reason everyone else dresses up and uses makeup
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.17,0:06:08.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,is to look good for others, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.01,0:06:15.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How is that different from me trying to look cute in front of the boys?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.60,0:06:25.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If I had to say, it's because when you try to look good {\i1}only{\i0} for the guys...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:26.24,0:06:30.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't I do the exact same thing, except with girls?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.07,0:06:31.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Uh oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.78,0:06:37.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't really feel the need to deny that others find me annoying. {uh...}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.04,0:06:41.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All I want is to continue to be who I want to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.84,0:06:48.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Here, a hand warmer.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.68,0:06:54.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Take it as thanks for the bunny strap. \NIt's not as cute, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.56,0:06:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.02,0:07:07.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I guess if you were to put a label on me, I'd be "anti-cutesy"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.08,0:07:16.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I hear you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.24,0:07:20.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I told you, you better buckle down for finals.
