Dialogue: 10,0:07:21.54,0:07:23.96,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tanaka-kun and Tanaka-sensei.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.34,0:07:26.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stay like this and you'll drop from the advanced track.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Advanced track!?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.30,0:07:32.22,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-kun's one of those advanced-track elites?! {he's obviously not an elite in the advanced class since his grades are relatively low}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.68,0:07:36.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.39,0:07:38.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nothing!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.23,0:07:45.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Remember to be courteous when entering the faculty office.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.86,0:07:47.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.98,voice sfx,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\frz28.24\bord0.9\pos(297.143,164.286)\3c&H283A6E&\1c&H283A6E&\fad(210,0)}Tch...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.98,voice sfx,,0,0,0,,{\frz28.24\blur0.6\pos(297.143,164.286)\fad(210,0)}Tch...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.00,0:08:06.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's a lot for you to handle alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.29,0:08:11.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Those "friends" of yours couldn't spare their precious time to help?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.34,0:08:14.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you think it's so much, why don't {\i1}you{\i0} lend a hand?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.68,0:08:16.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.64,0:08:21.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What a pain. See ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.64,0:08:23.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really won't help?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.69,0:08:26.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What a brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.81,0:08:28.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.57,0:08:30.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.53,0:08:35.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll get those for you. What class are you in?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.28,0:08:38.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you friends with Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.16,0:08:41.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We were in middle school.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,For a little while, at least.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.83,0:08:46.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.59,0:08:50.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Glad to hear it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.30,0:08:55.05,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why is Tanaka-sensei so happy about that?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.05,0:08:57.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,And seriously, he needs to fix that bed head.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.34,0:09:00.89,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He may act all brusque, but try to get along with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.89,0:09:02.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't ask the impossible!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.10,0:09:10.27,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I've really gotta stop looking for the old Tanaka-kun everywhere.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.27,0:09:13.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure Class 2's that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.90,0:09:16.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've got some business upstairs.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.36,0:09:19.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, sure. Thanks for the help.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.41,0:09:24.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.80,0:09:37.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.01,0:09:43.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I heard you're not coming to our after-finals karaoke party.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.18,0:09:44.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You haven't gone to a single class gathering.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.39,0:09:49.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Can't you show your face for once? {is this too hostile?}{gai ra kona}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.40,0:09:53.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:53.11,0:09:56.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not like I have any attachment to the class anyway.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.49,0:09:58.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.70,0:10:03.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business, Kominato-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There you are, Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.09,0:10:12.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure dragged your feet getting here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:15.38,0:10:17.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Those "friends" of yours...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.93,0:10:19.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Check out this makeup.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.84,0:10:20.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, hers? {wat}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.97,0:10:23.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, here. It'd look great on you.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.26,0:10:25.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Nah, that's way too flashy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.43,0:10:25.64,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even if they're only friends in name....
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.64,0:10:26.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just try it out.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What're you looking at?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.94,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's leagues better than being alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.85,0:10:32.31,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Isn't this totally nasty?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's that in your pocket?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.03,0:10:37.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.95,0:10:39.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Makita-san gave it to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.70,0:10:43.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ew, gross. What made her do that? {wanted to say 'came over you?' but it kind of doesn't work}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.62,0:10:45.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I saw her eating lunch alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:45.54,0:10:47.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ha, so she's a loner!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.54,0:10:52.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But hey, I bet she likes being alone.{maybe something like "But hey, whatever floats her boat."}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:54.59,0:10:57.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming to talk with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.88,0:11:00.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She's got nerves of steel.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.59,0:11:02.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you really think so?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.14,0:11:04.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.31,0:11:09.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever. If she ever feels lonely, she can just go hit a guy up. {is this font one of those "double space after a period" fonts}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.98,0:11:15.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right? He'll take good care of her, so it's no problem.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.03,0:11:23.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Besides, isn't acting different just for the guys kinda foul play?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:24.28,0:11:26.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you're calling it foul play,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.12,0:11:31.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,that means you're jealous of her because the guys think she's cute. {technically "envious"}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.04,0:11:38.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want, \Nquit whining and be cutesy like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.13,0:11:43.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? I don't wanna go that far just for some attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.55,0:11:47.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,All I'm saying is that I hate girls like her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:47.06,0:11:49.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then just leave her alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.06,0:11:53.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're so envious, you never stop complaining about her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.94,0:11:59.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Trying to put someone down might make you feel like you're on top of the world,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.99,0:12:03.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but it's the complete opposite!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.04,0:12:13.96,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I messed up!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.76,0:12:30.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:35.06,0:12:37.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you really hate me that much,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:37.86,0:12:42.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,then it means that I've got a nice little place inside your minds.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.82,0:12:46.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Serves you right! {oh god distain me more Kayano Ai}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.87,0:12:49.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.58,0:12:53.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,God, I feel like throwing up.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.30,0:13:03.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now we know what you really think about us.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.93,0:13:07.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.68,0:13:12.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I just didn't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.77,0:13:17.31,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I spent all this time desperately striving for that one thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.40,0:13:19.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.69,0:13:22.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It's all so stupid.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.15,0:13:24.40,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Yoshioka-san!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.57,0:13:27.91,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.91,0:13:30.78,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Thank you for sticking up for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.33,0:13:33.12,AoHaru,,0,0,5,,Please don't thank me.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.66,0:13:37.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It wasn't you I was sticking up for.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.50,0:13:41.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was doing it for myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.17,0:13:46.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I dragged you into it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.05,0:13:50.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But it still made me happy!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.19,0:14:03.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Seriously, what am I doing...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why did I spill all that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.70,0:14:13.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've always kept my thoughts bottled up inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's like you're all just pretending to be friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.62,0:14:19.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's pointless.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.38,0:14:28.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why're you all by yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.01,0:14:32.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What happened to those friends of yours?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:34.35,0:14:37.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I-It's all because you couldn't keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.73,0:14:38.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.31,0:14:42.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the one who said we were pretending to be friends!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.15,0:14:45.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So it's my fault?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.61,0:14:50.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.08,0:14:54.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I lost sight of everything but my goal,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and forgot what was really important. {final change to now match OP}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.00,0:15:07.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Things like emotional connections and trust...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.30,0:15:10.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.51,0:15:17.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for shouting at you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.86,0:15:28.49,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm so pathetic. Messing up every step of the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:31.70,0:15:33.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's head to the arcade after school.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.70,0:15:35.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I haven't got any money, man.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.28,0:15:36.33,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,People!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.41,0:15:39.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're still here?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.87,0:15:43.08,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,There're more over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.64,0:15:58.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, can't wait till later to flirt?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.48,0:16:07.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What?! You're hiding me, but still!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:08.69,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}kudarizaka fumikiri made
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.85,0:16:08.69,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}Before I knew it, I had run
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:13.74,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}atashi wa muchuu de hashitta
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.69,0:16:13.74,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}all the way down to the train tracks.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.07,0:16:14.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Mixed in with his cologne is a faintly nostalgic scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:19.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}kono koi wo saegiru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.74,0:16:19.37,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}What I found was that the train had departed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:24.29,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}densha wa sugisatta
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.37,0:16:24.29,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}and taken my love with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.92,0:16:26.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you were that caught up in your goal... {1) mistake, 2) I have a fetish for consistency and repetition}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:29.96,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}tooi hi no kioku  umi no kagayaki
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.29,0:16:29.96,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}Distant memories, shining seas.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.25,0:16:33.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well, that just means you were so desperate that you lost sight of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.84,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}kisetsu wa meguru
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:32.84,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}Seasons pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.22,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}hikoukigumo ni me wo hosomete
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.84,0:16:37.22,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}Now, I squint up at the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:42.60,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}chiisaku yureta himawari
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.22,0:16:42.60,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}A sunflower swayed in the breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:48.98,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}sayonara mo ienai mata
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.60,0:16:48.98,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}seeing how I couldn't even say goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.65,0:16:52.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,T-Tanaka-kun, I can't tell if you're actually kind or mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:58.83,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}hon no suumiri no sukima de sotto kusuguru itami
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.98,0:16:58.83,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}We were so tantalizingly close, yet so far apart.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't ask me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.53,0:16:57.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:04.33,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}manatsu ni kieta hanabi ga
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.83,0:17:04.33,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}If only the summer fireworks
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.08,0:17:02.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And also, stop calling me "Tanaka" already.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:10.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}namida no saki ni utsureba
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:10.30,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}had appeared before my tears...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.50,0:17:05.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:08.13,0:17:11.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it's painful for him to be called that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:15.72,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}I will kitto omoidasu wa
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.30,0:17:15.72,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}I will definitely remember.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.13,0:17:17.64,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But still, if I called him Mabuchi, it'd really be like the Tanaka-kun I once knew
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:27.48,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}anata ni todoke kono basho de atashi wa matteiru
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.72,0:17:27.48,Ich werde,,0,0,0,fx,{\fade(200,200)}Please know that I'll be here, waiting for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.18,0:17:21.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,will have completely disappeared.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:21.52,0:17:22.77,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I don't want that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.56,0:17:25.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:28.81,0:17:30.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Suddenly calling me by my first name?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.15,0:17:33.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Would it be better if I added a "-kun"?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.28,0:17:35.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,"Kou-kun" sound good?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.24,0:17:37.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't care either way.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.70,0:17:39.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.53,0:17:41.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Scary...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.75,0:17:48.83,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,But I guess that means I'm free to call him by his first name.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.42,0:17:53.46,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He didn't say I couldn't.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.68,0:18:01.51,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Ever since then,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.43,0:18:04.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to talk to Asumi or Chie-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.19,0:18:11.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Time passed...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:16.65,chalkboard,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fax-.2\fry-5\blur1\fs80\frz8.003\c&HEEF5ED&\pos(539.666,164)}C{*\c&HECF3EB&}l{*\c&HEBF2EA&}o{*\c&HE9F0E9&}s{*\c&HE8EFE7&}i{*\c&HE6EEE6&}n{*\c&HE5ECE5&}g {*\c&HE2EAE2&}C{*\c&HE1E8E1&}e{*\c&HDFE7DF&}r{*\c&HDEE5DE&}e{*\c&HDCE4DD&}m{*\c&HDBE3DB&}o{*\c&HD9E1DA&}n{*\c&HD8E0D9&}y{\c&HD7DFD8&}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.11,0:18:16.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stand. Bow. {I have strong feelings about this one}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm free!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.65,0:18:18.61,chalkboard,,0,0,0,,{\an2\fs18\blur0.6\pos(856.635,274.54)\c&HD5DDC4&}Closing Ceremony
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Finally!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.53,0:18:25.04,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Is this really what I want?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:26.25,0:18:31.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I mean, we probably won't even end up in the same class next year anyway...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.26,0:18:39.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Asumi, Chie-chan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.72,0:18:42.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:42.18,0:18:44.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.10,0:18:47.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,S-Sorry about what happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.23,0:18:50.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have said it like I did.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.06,0:18:53.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:54.36,0:18:56.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Those were my true feelings.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.57,0:19:04.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was always afraid you might hate me, so I never acted like myself,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.91,0:19:06.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.71,0:19:10.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...who I am.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.51,0:19:18.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I get how you feel.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.09,0:19:24.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And well, if that's how you really are,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.01,0:19:27.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't think we can be friends anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.06,0:19:31.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm not saying you're a bad person or anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.40,0:19:37.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's just... we don't go well together.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.36,0:19:40.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.70,0:19:42.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, Asumi!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.57,0:19:44.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.12,0:19:50.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.42,0:19:59.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You know how when we were younger...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.34,0:20:04.85,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,...our teachers told us to play nice with our friends?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.68,0:20:09.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Back then, I wholeheartedly believed in those words.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.81,0:20:11.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.56,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I understand there are times things don't go well.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.15,0:20:19.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What the teachers never told us
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.07,0:20:22.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,was what to do when everything failed.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.41,0:20:26.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka-san—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.07,0:20:29.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are some things that you can't change! That's obvious! {I'm disappointed you didn't use a "can't be helped"}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.62,0:20:34.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:36.46,0:20:40.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There are so many things I want to talk with you about. {it's kind of weird that her previous "I..." doesn't lead anywhere but whatever}
Dialogue: 10,0:20:41.88,0:20:42.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.89,0:20:46.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.10,0:20:48.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, bye-bye.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.06,0:20:56.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'll keep on learning things I was never taught.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.40,0:21:03.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Today I learned that coming to a clean decision is one kind of strength.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.07,0:21:09.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger now than I was back then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.58,0:21:16.21,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I wonder why...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.83,0:21:19.34,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why do I have this incredible urge
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,to go see Kou? {I know you meant these three lines as one sentence but there weren't enough ellipses and enough ellipses were also too many ellipses}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.59,0:21:25.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Not the Tanaka-kun I knew in middle school,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.47,0:21:27.01,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but the Kou of today.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:28.26,0:21:33.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to feel the sense of bonding that we shared that moment
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.06,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,one more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:41.61,0:21:44.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did he go home already?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:45.03,0:21:46.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who're you looking for?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.45,0:21:54.37,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou!
